<!--
  The strings every notification is worded with on this phone: `:push-wording`'s PushWording,
  CardWording and ReminderWording read them by name (`AndroidWordingStrings`, the key Compose
  Multiplatform names), so no code references their R ids and the release build's resource shrinker
  would otherwise remove them: a push would then show a card's base-English preview, or fail to word
  at all. The list is push-wording/push-keys.txt's, one entry per key (`@plurals/` for a plural);
  tools/test/push-keys.test.js fails when a key there is not kept here. `activity_*` and `sticker_*`
  stay kept whole, as they were before the wording moved: the cards' sentences and subjects, and a
  sticker card's phrase.
-->
